  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1 (2026-10-25): patch release with no API changes. A float[] parameter now reaches a VECTOR(n) column as a vector instead of the literal text \"System.Single[]\", and ORDER BY vec_distance_*() LIMIT k now reaches the vector index instead of a full scan. Previous: v2.1.0 (2026-10-10): net11.0-only (C# 15 preview). Munarium-inspired lexical stack: a classifying tokenizer (numbers, sign absorption, hyphen compounds), PostgreSQL-16 English stop words, an English word-only stemmer and a BM25 inverted index with positions.",
